id: SCA-075
title: Suspicious npm lifecycle script with inline Node.js execution
category: supply-chain
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: package.json
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: "(preinstall|postinstall|install)"\s*:\s*"node\s+-e\s
    message: Lifecycle script uses node -e with inline code execution during npm install — common supply chain obfuscation technique.
fix: Install scripts should never contain inline Node.js code. Reference a script file instead and audit its contents. Use --ignore-scripts for untrusted packages.
